38220>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38220>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38220>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38220>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38220>>>>>
38220>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38221>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38222>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38223>>>>>
38223>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38223>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38224>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38225>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38226>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38227>>>>>
38227>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38229>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38230>>>>>        End
38230>>>>>>
38230>>>>>        Else Begin
38231>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38232>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38233>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38234>>>>>        End
38234>>>>>>
38234>>>>>    End_Procedure
